egories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Ssur8TPCIZWnZeCDQ9avQQ","review_id":"Mz1aW1_5T8E2ID-qfE7dVA","date":"2015-06-17T01:39:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9365776181221008,"text_excerpt":"Lunch on the lake at Landry's was amazing. I absolutely loved the experience from start to finish. My waitress was so kind and diligent. The summer sangrias were absolutely amazing-light, refreshing, and very flavorful. I had the fried shrimp which as simple as it sounds, we're by far the best fried shrimp I've had! My mom had the stuffed shrimp entree which was absolutely amazing. Lunch includes fries and onion strings (for my fellow indecisive/greedy ppl). The salad and balsamic honey mustard dressing was absolutely delightful! Definitely returning for happy hour!"},{"business_id":"Ssur8TPCIZWnZeCDQ9avQQ","review_id":"g8WEdWcE_GNasB6NlCullg","date":"2014-05-15T21:07:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9350969195365906,"text_excerpt":"My wife and I enjoyed a nice lunch date at Landry's! We chose to sit outside and enjoy the lake view on a beautiful day (which was wonderful minus the abundance of milkweed bugs). We started with the crawfish bread which was to die for! Then followed by their house salad which had an amazing mustard vinaigrette dressing. We shared a seafood platter (fried fish, oysters, and shrimp w/ fries and onion rings) and it was pretty good but not great. We also shared a crab cake sandwich that we seemed to favor over the seafood platter. Our server was very friendly and attentive to our needs to the best of his ability, given he had two other tables in this section outside. He was the only employee..."},{"business_id":"Ssur8TPCIZWnZeCDQ9avQQ","review_id":"hIVO4InYFAbabbEoejysTQ","date":"2020-11-14T00:35:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9338617324829102,"text_excerpt":"Each time I've visited Landry's I have thoroughly enjoyed the food. I usually get the crawfish bread and calamari when I'm selecting items for their happy hour \"bites\" menu. The drinks took the cake for me today though! I tried their strawberry margarita on the rocks which was the perfect t way to start my evening. The drink was refreshing and the extremely tasty. I went all in a tried the Mai Thai which is always pretty strong (and delicious) in my opinion! The sunset view from the outdoor patio area is simply unmatched and if you want to enjoy the happy hour specials you must request to be seated outdoors. The restaurants is extremely large so if you prefer to be seated indoors you have..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Ssur8TPCIZWnZeCDQ9avQQ","photo_id":"--AU_cPMgrWSPluP1v8n_Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/--AU_cPMgrWSPluP1v8n_Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9044174551963806},{"business_id":"Ssur8TPCIZWnZeCDQ9avQQ","photo_id":"CPVfNeMncGmFkOI13tYWAA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CPVfNeMncGmFkOI13tYWAA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9021270275115967},{"business_id":"Ssur8TPCIZWnZeCDQ9avQQ","photo_id":"H6n0wFdMOUa4sjhAstCcuA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/H6n0wFdMOUa4sjhAstCcuA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8870038986206055},{"business_id":"Ssur8TPCIZWnZeCDQ9avQQ","photo_id":"-GKrGDoFOhK5iv-tJ0tCRw","la